  "releaseNotes": "Improves MC68020, MC68030, and MC68040 instruction coverage and timing, including effective-address forms, prefetch, memory writeback, branch/DBcc, and interrupt-boundary behavior. Adds MC68010 format-zero exception frames, MC68030 translation-control MOVEC support, A1200/68EC020 timing integration, and more accurate MC68000 and JIT fast paths, alignment handling, and stack writes.",
